# How recipes/quickshell differs from upstream; bin/rebase-recipe re-applies it to each
# new upstream release (see its --help for the format, NOTES.md for the why).
# prepare() cds into the source, so the patch line needs no directory.
upstream omarchy-pkgs pkgbuilds/quickshell
mode overlay
keep NOTES.md UPSTREAM_PRS NO_DISTCC
pkgbuild-patch pkgbuild-pkgdesc-label.diff
# quickshell-mirror/quickshell#1385 (draft, checked 2026-11-01), its commit as is, less its
# changelog/next.md line; drop it once a quickshell release we build from has the fix
patch clock-dst-fall-back.patch prepare
